<h1>Glossary: Platform Categories (The CNAPP Alphabet)</h1>

<div class="col root"><div class="row"><div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#4493f8">TERM</div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#4493f8">MEANING</div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CNAPP</div><div class="d">Cloud-Native Application Protection Platform - one platform combining posture + workload + data + API security.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CSPM</div><div class="d">Cloud Security Posture Management - finds and ranks cloud misconfigurations (public buckets, open security groups).</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">AI-SPM / SPM</div><div class="d">Security Posture Management with AI-driven behavior analytics and risk scoring - proactive threat finding before exploitation.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CIEM</div><div class="d">Cloud Infrastructure Entitlement Management - least-privilege over identities: finds s3:*-style wildcards, unused keys, and over-privileged roles.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CWPP</div><div class="d">Cloud Workload Protection Platform - runtime protection of hosts and containers (syscall- and process-level).</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">DSPM</div><div class="d">Data Security Posture Management - discovers where sensitive data lives and who flows it out.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">ASPM</div><div class="d">Application Security Posture Management - bridges code vulnerabilities to cloud infrastructure exposure.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CTEM</div><div class="d">Continuous Threat Exposure Management - operating loop: enumerate attack surface → prioritize → validate → remediate.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">XDR</div><div class="d">Extended Detection &amp; Response - SIEM + endpoint detection + correlation under one umbrella.</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">MDR / managed SOC</div><div class="d">Managed Detection &amp; Response - a partner runs 24/7 detection/response for you (the &quot;agentic SOC&quot; products live here).</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">SOAR</div><div class="d">Security Orchestration, Automation &amp; Response - playbook engine that chains detections into automated actions (with HITL gates).</div></div></div>


